#: ../../source/readdir-enhanced_CHANGELOG.md:47
#, python-format
msgid ""
"As of this release, `readdir-enhanced` is fully tested on all major Node "
"versions (0.x, 4.x, 5.x, 6.x) on [linux](https://travis-"
"ci.org/BigstickCarpet/readdir-enhanced) and "
"[Windows](https://ci.appveyor.com/project/BigstickCarpet/readdir-"
"enhanced/branch/master), with [nearly 100% code "
"coverage](https://coveralls.io/github/BigstickCarpet/readdir-"
"enhanced?branch=master).  I do all of my local development and testing on"
" MacOS, so that's covered too."
msgstr ""

